<title>UK: Halifax B/S sets 2.0 bln Frf 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Halifax B/S sets 2.0 bln Frf 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole .</p>
<p> BORROWER   Halifax Building Society</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    05.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.654    PAY DATE    05.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.50 BP  REOFFER    99.654    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.50 BP  SELL CONC  20.0 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2003 AND 2004 OAT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
